<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L2_3_3" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L2_3_3">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L2_3_3" name="3.3 Dewatering &amp; Product Handling (L2)" processRef="Process_L2_3_3"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L2_3_3" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L2 Process Area. Removes water from flotation products. Saleable concentrates are thickened, filtered to the commercial moisture specification (typically 8–12% for copper and 6–10% for zinc or lead concentrate, by contract) and, where specified, dried and packed. The final tailings are thickened to the density the deposition method needs and handed to Tailings Management (3.5). Water recovered by thickening and filtration is handed to Water Management (3.6).</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L2_3_3">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L2_3_3_ops" name="DCS Auto-control / Control Room Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L2_3_3_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L2_3_3_g1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L2_3_3_g2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L2_3_3_m</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L2_3_3_e1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L2_3_3_e2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L2_3_3_s" name="Concentrate or tailings stream available">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1" name="3.3.1 Thickening">
      <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L2 Process. Reusable pattern, run once per thickener duty: each saleable concentrate stream, a bulk concentrate before separation (3.2.3.1), and the final tailings. Thickeners settle and compact slurry by gravity sedimentation, aided by flocculant. The underflow goes to its configured destination — filter feed, a concentrate pipeline, separation, or tailings transport (3.5.1) — and the overflow is recovered process water. Target underflow density depends on the duty (typically 55–70% solids for concentrate; for tailings it is set by the deposition method).
ISA-95 level: 0–2
Actors: DCS Auto-control; Control Room Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0–2; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 7
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: thickener_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L2_3_3_g1" name="Tailings stream?" default="Flow_L2_3_3_3">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_3</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2" name="3.3.2 Concentrate Filtration">
      <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L2 Process. The filter (disc filter, pressure filter, or belt filter depending on site) removes the majority of remaining process water from the thickened concentrate slurry, producing a filter cake at the target moisture specification. Moisture content verification of the filter cake is mandatory — it is a commercial product specification and a P754 mass measurement requirement. Separate filters run per concentrate type. Filtrate and wash water are recovered (3.3.2.4).
ISA-95 level: 0–2
Actors: DCS Auto-control; Control Room Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0–2; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 5, 7, 8
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (concentrate_production_record — moisture attribute)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L2_3_3_g2" name="Drying or packaging required?" default="Flow_L2_3_3_7">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_6</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3" name="3.3.3 Concentrate Drying &amp; Packaging">
      <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L3 Process. Conditional — applies where the product specification or the dispatch method requires the filtered concentrate to be dried or packed: for example, molybdenum concentrate dried and bagged, or concentrate packed in bags or containers for shipment. Follows 3.3.2 in that concentrate's dewatering train. Bulk-shipped filter cake bypasses it.
ISA-95 level: 0–3
Actors: Plant Operator; Process Technician; DCS
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0–3; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 5, 7, 8
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (concentrate_production_record — packaged mass)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L2_3_3_m">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_9</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L2_3_3_e1" name="Concentrate products handled">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_9</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L2_3_3_e2" name="Thickened tailings to 3.5">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="Msg_L2_3_3_e2"/>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_1" sourceRef="Start_L2_3_3_s" targetRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_2" sourceRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1" targetRef="Gw_L2_3_3_g1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_3" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L2_3_3_g1" targetRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_4" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L2_3_3_g1" targetRef="End_L2_3_3_e2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_5" sourceRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2" targetRef="Gw_L2_3_3_g2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_6" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L2_3_3_g2" targetRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_7" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L2_3_3_g2" targetRef="Gw_L2_3_3_m"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_8" sourceRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3" targetRef="Gw_L2_3_3_m"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_9" sourceRef="Gw_L2_3_3_m" targetRef="End_L2_3_3_e1"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L2_3_3">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L2_3_3" bpmnElement="Collab_L2_3_3">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L2_3_3_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L2_3_3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1552" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L2_3_3_ops_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L2_3_3_ops" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="1512" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L2_3_3_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L2_3_3_s"><dc:Bounds x="142" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="110" y="139" width="120" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="266" y="57" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L2_3_3_g1_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L2_3_3_g1" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="507" y="70" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="436" y="34" width="100" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="648" y="57" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L2_3_3_g2_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L2_3_3_g2" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="889" y="70" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="818" y="20" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="1030" y="57" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L2_3_3_m_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L2_3_3_m" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="1271" y="70" width="70" height="70"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L2_3_3_e1_di" bpmnElement="End_L2_3_3_e1"><dc:Bounds x="1444" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1412" y="139" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L2_3_3_e2_di" bpmnElement="End_L2_3_3_e2"><dc:Bounds x="705" y="247" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="673" y="309" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_1"><di:waypoint x="198" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="266" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_2"><di:waypoint x="436" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="507" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_3"><di:waypoint x="577" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="648" y="105"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="581" y="85" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_4"><di:waypoint x="542" y="140"/><di:waypoint x="542" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="705" y="275"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="548" y="144" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_5"><di:waypoint x="818" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="889" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_6"><di:waypoint x="959" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="1030" y="105"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="963" y="85" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_7"><di:waypoint x="924" y="70"/><di:waypoint x="924" y="40"/><di:waypoint x="1306" y="40"/><di:waypoint x="1306" y="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="930" y="52" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_8_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_8"><di:waypoint x="1200" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="1271" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_9_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_9"><di:waypoint x="1341" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="1444" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
